This repository redistributes a patched copy of the `parse` Python module.

Upstream: https://github.com/r1chardj0n3s/parse (MIT License)
Base commit: cf27a9bb66f68a42a467484693b5343be8242197
Copyright (c) 2012-2019 Richard Jones and contributors (original notice
above, preserved verbatim).

Changes are confined to parse/__init__.py: parse()/search() now reuse a
semantics-keyed LRU cache of Parser objects instead of rebuilding and
recompiling the format on every call. See patch.diff and README.md.
